WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with a persona. Fitting shows how their world becomes colour, type, and an interface.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:14.200
In Material, adjust the cloth. Your changes stay in this browser.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.200
Tokens gives you the design system, with OpenPencil here too.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.640
Keep references and notes together in Moodboard.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.160
Use Taste to say what works for you, and why.
